  "SM_001020_0080_NAR": "『どうすれば[RUBY:BASE ]魔界[RUBY:BEGIN ]まかい[RUBY:END ]へ[RUBY:BASE ]帰[RUBY:BEGIN ]かえ[RUBY:END ]す[RUBY:BASE ]力[RUBY:BEGIN ]ちから[RUBY:END ]が[RUBY:BASE ]手[RUBY:BEGIN ]て[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]入[RUBY:BEGIN ]はい[RUBY:END ]る？』\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]悪魔[RUBY:BEGIN ]あくま[RUBY:END ]はセレッサに[RUBY:BASE ]尋[RUBY:BEGIN ]たず[RUBY:END ]ねます。",
