  "SM_001090_0020_NAR#2": "[RUBY:BASE ]白[RUBY:BEGIN ]しろ[RUBY:END ]いオオカミを[RUBY:BASE ]見[RUBY:BEGIN ]み[RUBY:END ]つけました。\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]二人[RUBY:BEGIN ]ふたり[RUBY:END ]は[RUBY:BASE ]急[RUBY:BEGIN ]いそ[RUBY:END ]いで\r\nオオカミの[RUBY:BASE ]後[RUBY:BEGIN ]あと[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]追[RUBY:BEGIN ]お[RUBY:END ]いかけます。",
